  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The given equation of Parabola can be written as\n\\(\\begin{aligned}\n&\\left(x-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^2-8 y+19-\\frac{1}{4}=0 \\\\\n&\\left(x-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^2=8 y-\\frac{76-1}{4} \\\\\n& \\Rightarrow\\left(x-\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^2=8\\left(y-\\frac{75}{32}\\right) \\therefore \\text { vertex }=\\left(\\frac{1}{2}, \\frac{75}{32}\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\)",
    "image": null
